    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh cilantro",
    "1 lime, juiced",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "1 teaspoon sambal oelek (chile paste)",
    "1 pinch red pepper flakes, or to taste",
    "salt to taste"
